      "ar": "ض",
      "aud": "c-0-ar",
      "tr": "Dad"
    },
    {
      "en": "Like Sad but with a single dot on top. Arabic is called 'Lughat al-Dad' — The Language of Dad! Dad is UNIQUE — no other language has this sound! Arabic is the Language of Dad!",
      "title": "How to write Dad"
    },
    {
      "en": "With a fatha, Dad says “da”.",
      "title": "Dad with fatha",
      "ar": "ضَ",
      "aud": "c-2-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "With a kasra, Dad says “de”.",
      "title": "Dad with kasra",
      "ar": "ضِ",
      "aud": "c-3-ar"
    },
    {
      "en": "With a damma, Dad says “do”.",
      "title": "Dad with damma",
      "ar": "ضُ",
      "aud": "c-4-ar"
